\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Jesus, I have promised
\par To serve Thee to the end;
\par Be Thou for ever near me,
\par My Master and my Friend:
\par I shall not fear the battle
\par If Thou art by my side,
\par Nor wander from the pathway
\par If Thou wilt be my Guide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O let me feel Thee near me;
\par The world is ever near;
\par I see the sights that dazzle,
\par The tempting sounds I hear;
\par My foes are ever near me,
\par Around me and within;
\par But, Jesus, draw Thou nearer,
\par And shield my soul from sin.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O let me hear Thee speaking
\par In accents clear and still,
\par Above the storms of passion,
\par The murmurs of self-will;
\par O speak to reassure me,
\par To chasten or control;
\par O speak, and make me listen,
\par Thou Guardian of my soul.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O Jesus, Thou hast promised,
\par To all who follow Thee,
\par That where Thou art in glory
\par There shall servant be;
\par And, Jesus, I have promised
\par To serve Thee to the end:
\par O give me grace to follow,
\par My Master and my Friend.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

